{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in specifications. The policy gives priority to move_forward in clear conditions, uses short directed turns for side/front obstacles, allows a rare one-shot backward escape only from a dedicated front-obstacle recovery state, and reserves full_rotate for a dedicated last-resort stuck state after repeated front blockage. Action states are one-shot and obstacle events force recovery while path_clear usually self-loops in commit states to respect open-loop pulse semantics.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate unrestricted sensing and actuation plants from supervisory policy specifications",
    "Bias clear conditions to forward progress, use directed turns for ordinary recovery, and use backward/full_rotate only in dedicated rare recovery chains"
  ],
